{"id": "sample-011", "app": "sample", "appVersion": "1.0", "scenarioType": "listSearch", "scenario": "sample-list-search-open", "style": "imperative", "tags": ["implicitTarget"], "origin": "team", "author": "hasan", "text": "Yılmaz'ı ara, sonuçlar gelince Aç'a tıkla ve açılan detay ekranında Ad Soyad alanında 'Ayşe Yılmaz' yazdığını doğrula.", "gold": {"version": "0.2", "steps": [{"keyword": "Type", "target": "main.searchInput", "value": "Yılmaz"}, {"keyword": "Click", "target": "main.searchButton"}, {"keyword": "Click", "target": "main.openButton"}, {"keyword": "Verify", "target": "detail.nameInput", "checkpoint": {"property": "value", "operator": "equals", "expected": "Ayşe Yılmaz"}}]}, "notes": "Yılmaz'ı ara is Type + Click Ara (4.1). sonuçlar gelince adds no Wait: the Click waits for Aç to be enabled (4.3). With no row selected Aç opens the first match."}
